### Banking Transactions API — Sample Requests
### Compatible with VS Code REST Client extension

@base = http://localhost:8000

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Root
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### GET root
GET {{base}}/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Create transactions
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### POST — deposit to ACC-12345
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-00000",
  "toAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 1000.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit"
}

###

### POST — transfer ACC-12345 → ACC-67890
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 250.50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "transfer"
}

###

### POST — withdrawal from ACC-67890
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "toAccount": "ACC-VAULT",
  "amount": 75.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "withdrawal"
}

###

### POST — validation error (negative amount)
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": -50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "transfer"
}

###

### POST — validation error (bad account format)
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 100,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "transfer"
}

###

### POST — validation error (invalid currency)
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 100,
  "currency": "XYZ",
  "type": "transfer"
}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# List & filter transactions
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### GET all transactions
GET {{base}}/transactions

###

### GET transactions for account ACC-12345
GET {{base}}/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345

###

### GET only transfer transactions
GET {{base}}/transactions?type=transfer

###

### GET transactions with date range
GET {{base}}/transactions?from=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&to=2030-12-31T23:59:59Z

###

### GET transactions — combined filter
GET {{base}}/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345&type=transfer

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get specific transaction
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### GET transaction by ID (replace with real UUID from POST response)
GET {{base}}/transactions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Account endpoints
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### GET balance for ACC-12345
GET {{base}}/accounts/ACC-12345/balance

###

### GET summary for ACC-12345
GET {{base}}/accounts/ACC-12345/summary

###

### GET balance for ACC-67890
GET {{base}}/accounts/ACC-67890/balance
